{
  "id": 8319002738863,
  "title": "Winco ALRK-15 15-Tier Aluminum End-Load Sheet Pan Rack / Bun Tray Rack with Solid Top",
  "handle": "winco-alrk-15-15-tier-aluminum-end-load-sheet-pan-rack-bun-tray-rack-with-solid-top",
  "body_html": "<h2>Winco ALRK-15 15-Tier Aluminum End-Load Sheet Pan Rack / Bun Tray Rack with Solid Top</h2>\n<!-- split -->\n<div class=\"mainProdContainer\">\n<div class=\"prod-desc-container\">\n<p>Made for the most demanding restaurant kitchens. Save space by storing multiple sheet pans in one convenient location.</p>\n<ul class=\"summarylist\">\n<li class=\"list-checkmark\">15 Tier end load sheet pan rack</li>\n<li class=\"list-checkmark\">Aluminum construction w/ stainless steel solid top</li>\n<li class=\"list-checkmark\">4 5\" diameter swivel casters</li>\n<li class=\"list-checkmark\">Hold 15 full size pans or 30 half size pans</li>\n<li class=\"list-checkmark\">Pans are not included</li>\n<li class=\"list-checkmark\">Ships knocked down</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>Features</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>15 plated steel wire slides at 1-3/4\u2033 spacing</li>\n<li>Stainless steel solid top is useful as a work surface, and can also help to transport bulky items</li>\n<li>14 gauge 6063 aluminum with 1\u2033 extruded tube frame</li>\n<li>Full swivel casters, 5\u2033 diameter x 1-1/4\u2033</li>\n<li>Holds 15 full-size (18\u2033 x 26\u2033) or 30 half-size (18\u2033 x 13\u2033) sheet pans (not included)</li>\n<li>Capacity: up to 400 lbs</li>\n<li>Ships knocked down</li>\n<li>Assembled dimensions: 20-7/8\u2033L x 26-1/8\u2033W x 31-5/8\u2033H</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>Specifications</h5>\n</div>\n</div>\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n.tg  {border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;}\n.tg td{border-color:black;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\n  overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;word-break:normal;}\n.tg th{border-color:black;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\n  font-weight:normal;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;word-break:normal;}\n.tg .tg-cly1{text-align:left;vertical-align:middle}\n.tg .tg-yla0{font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle}\n</style>\n<div class=\"mainProdContainer\">\n<div class=\"prod-desc-container\">\n<table class=\"tg\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"tg-yla0\">Model</th>\n<th class=\"tg-cly1\">ALRK-15</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-yla0\">Width</td>\n<td class=\"tg-cly1\">20.87 Inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-yla0\">Depth</td>\n<td class=\"tg-cly1\">26.12 Inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-yla0\">Height</td>\n<td class=\"tg-cly1\">31.62 Inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-yla0\">Number Of Tiers</td>\n<td class=\"tg-cly1\">15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-yla0\">Pan Capacity</td>\n<td class=\"tg-cly1\">15 Full Size Pan / 30 Half Size Pan</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-yla0\">Casters</td>\n<td class=\"tg-cly1\">4 of 5\" Casters</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-yla0\">Material</td>\n<td class=\"tg-cly1\">Aluminum</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-yla0\">Product Type</td>\n<td class=\"tg-cly1\">Pan Rack</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"certifications\">\n<div class=\"certs\">\n<h5>What Our Experts Think</h5>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"170\">\n<strong data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"52\">15-Tier Capacity</strong> \u2013 Holds up to <strong data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"107\" data-is-only-node=\"\">15 full-size sheet pans or bun trays</strong>, ideal for <strong data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"167\">bakeries, restaurants, and catering kitchens</strong>.</li>\n<li data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"285\">\n<strong data-start=\"173\" data-end=\"192\">End-Load Design</strong> \u2013 Allows for <strong data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"227\" data-is-only-node=\"\">fast front access</strong>, speeding up workflow in high-volume prep environments.</li>\n<li data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"399\">\n<strong data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"314\">Durable Aluminum Build</strong> \u2013 Lightweight, <strong data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"353\" data-is-only-node=\"\">corrosion-resistant</strong>, and made for <strong data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"396\">long-term commercial use</strong>.</li>\n<li data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"504\">\n<strong data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"421\">Solid Top Shelf</strong> \u2013 Adds <strong data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"459\" data-is-only-node=\"\">extra workspace or storage</strong>, perfect for staging ingredients or tools.</li>\n<li data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"618\">\n<strong data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"533\">Smooth-Rolling Casters</strong> \u2013 Makes transport easy, even when fully loaded; includes <strong data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"615\" data-is-only-node=\"\">brakes for stability</strong>.</li>\n<li data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"710\">\n<strong data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"645\">Vertical Space Saver</strong> \u2013 Offers <strong data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"707\" data-is-only-node=\"\">high capacity without taking up much floor space</strong>.</li>\n<li data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"823\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\n<strong data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"733\">Multi-Functional</strong> \u2013 Great for <strong data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"783\" data-is-only-node=\"\">cooling, storing, or transporting</strong> baked goods, sheet-pan meals, and more.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>Q&amp;A</h5>\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"163\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"33\">Q: What is the Winco ALRK-15?</strong><br data-start=\"33\" data-end=\"36\">A: A 15-tier aluminum end-load rack with a solid top, designed to hold standard sheet pans or bun trays in commercial kitchens.</p>\n<p data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"280\"><strong data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"203\">Q: What type of pans does it hold?</strong><br data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"206\">A: Accommodates up to fifteen 18\" x 26\" full-size sheet pans or bun trays.</p>\n<p data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"414\"><strong data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"324\">Q: What is unique about the solid top?</strong><br data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"327\">A: The solid top adds extra workspace or can be used as a prep surface or storage area.</p>\n<p data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"541\"><strong data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"442\">Q: What is it made of?</strong><br data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"445\">A: Constructed from lightweight, durable aluminum for rust resistance and commercial durability.</p>\n<p data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"661\"><strong data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"567\">Q: How mobile is it?</strong><br data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"570\">A: Comes with four swivel casters for smooth movement; ideal for busy kitchen environments.</p>\n<p data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"775\"><strong data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"698\">Q: Is it end-load or side-load?</strong><br data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"701\">A: It\u2019s an end-load design for convenient pan access and space efficiency.</p>\n<p data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"920\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"811\">Q: Who is this rack ideal for?</strong><br data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"814\">A: Great for bakeries, restaurants, and food service operations needing reliable pan storage and mobility.</p>\n<h5>Maintenance Tips</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"certs\">\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"209\">\n<strong data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"106\">Clean After Use:</strong> Wipe with warm, soapy water; rinse and dry thoroughly to prevent corrosion and food residue buildup.</li>\n<li data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"324\">\n<strong data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"231\">Top Shelf Care:</strong> Use the solid top as a prep or storage surface\u2014clean it frequently to maintain sanitation.</li>\n<li data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"412\">\n<strong data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"347\">Avoid Abrasives:</strong> Use non-scratch cloths or pads to protect the aluminum finish.</li>\n<li data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"523\">\n<strong data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"432\">Caster Check:</strong> Inspect and clean wheels regularly; ensure brakes work properly and lubricate if needed.</li>\n<li data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"614\">\n<strong data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"543\">Even Loading:</strong> Distribute pans evenly to maintain structural integrity and balance.</li>\n<li data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"694\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\n<strong data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"631\">Store Dry:</strong> Keep in a clean, dry area to maximize durability and lifespan.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- NO SPEC SHEET -->",
